  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "生命起源與生物科技",
    "sub_ename": "ORIGIN OF LIFE AND BIOLOGICAL TECHNOLOGY",
    "describe_ch": "經由生命的起源的介紹，同學們可以了解人類對於地球上生命形成的觀察與理論的推論。這些推論可以讓同學們動腦，訓練學生的邏輯思考能力。\n人類如何從靈長類的動物們脫穎而出，變得直立又聰明，會說話又能思考。演化的過程中一定發生了分歧點。讓我們利用科學家的假說來推論看看。\n此外本課程介紹一些遺傳性疾病，讓同學跨領域地理解發病的原因，發病後對病人的照護以及社會安全的保護，讓同學積極面向人生，追求樂活。\n",
    "describe_eh": "By way of the introduction of origin of life, students can understand theories about the formation of lives and how these theories were constructed. These trainings will make students think and improve their abilities of logical thinking. \nHow humans transformed from primates and turned to be intelligent, able to speak and ponder. In the evolved process, there was certainly the divergence point. Let us use scientist's hypothesis to deduce the phenomenon.\nIn addition, this course will introduce some hereditary diseases, allowing students to understand the causes of the disease across fields, the care of patients after the disease, and the protection of social security, so that students can actively face life and pursue happiness.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
